## Where posts start

This is the first section of a sample post. It uses the same narrow text column as the case studies, so long paragraphs stay easy to read. You can use **bold**, *italics* and [links](https://disha-shah.io) anywhere.

Each heading starts a new section, and the progress rail on the left follows along as you scroll.

![A homepage layout](/blog-img/sample-inline.webp)

## A second section

Lists work too:

- Short, scannable points
- With room for **emphasis**
- And links

> A quote from someone, set apart from the paragraphs around it.

### A small label

Smaller headings work as labels inside a section.

---

## Wrapping up

Images, galleries, videos, callouts and pull quotes can all be inserted with the slash key in the editor.
